# Neon Voice Studio - Professional TTS Generator

![Neon Voice Studio Demo](demo-screenshot.png) *(Replace with your actual screenshot)*

A sleek, professional text-to-speech web application built with Flask and Edge TTS, featuring 20+ neural voices with preview capabilities and high-quality audio output.

## Features ✨

- **20+ Neural Voices**: Choose from a variety of English accents (US, UK, Indian, Australian, etc.)
- **Voice Previews**: Listen to samples before generating full audio
- **Professional Design**: Dark theme with subtle neon accents
- **Advanced Features**:
  - Audio duration display
  - Professional filename generation for downloads
  - Responsive layout works on all devices
- **Real-time Processing**: Fast audio generation using Microsoft Edge TTS

## Technology Stack 🛠️

- **Backend**: Python + Flask
- **TTS Engine**: Microsoft Edge TTS (`edge-tts`)
- **Frontend**: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript
- **Styling**: Custom neon-themed CSS with animations

